    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "opd_kd_problem_text",
      "x": 78,
      "y": 570,
      "width": 604,
      "height": 68,
      "text": "问题：Exposure Bias（Train-Inference Distribution Mismatch）\n训练见正确前缀；推理时一旦采样偏差，后续都基于从未见过的错误前缀",
      "originalText": "问题：Exposure Bias（Train-Inference Distribution Mismatch）\n训练见正确前缀；推理时一旦采样偏差，后续都基于从未见过的错误前缀",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
