    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "opd_band_text",
      "x": 78,
      "y": 1378,
      "width": 604,
      "height": 56,
      "text": "核心区别：KD 在 Teacher 固定轨迹上蒸馏；\nOPD 让 Student 按当前策略自采样，Teacher 在 Student 实际访问的状态上\n给 token-level 监督 → 消除 Exposure Bias",
      "originalText": "核心区别：KD 在 Teacher 固定轨迹上蒸馏；\nOPD 让 Student 按当前策略自采样，Teacher 在 Student 实际访问的状态上\n给 token-level 监督 → 消除 Exposure Bias",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
